==Overview==
The '''Jetpack Police Toilet''' is an enemy that appears in [[Hard Mode|Hard]] and [[Nightmare Mode]]. It has an average amount of health, around the same as the [[Boss Toilet]]. However, it is quite fast, as it has a jetpack in it's back. 

Jetpack Police Toilet's ability is that it can shoot rockets at units to stun them.
==Appearance==
The Jetpack Police Toilet looks like a [[Police Toilet]] with a different face. It has some extra protection, 4 nailguns, and a jetpack to move faster.
==Health==
Wave 10: 15400 HP
==Waves==
TBA
==Abilities==
*Shoot: Shoots a rocket at a unit, stunning it for ? seconds.
==Strategy==
*The Jetpack Police Toilet has an average HP. More expensive units like [[Large Cameraman|Large Camerman]] (spammed) should do the job.
*You can use the [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone]] to unstun units.
*Use high range unit such as [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]].
== Trivia==
*It is based off of the Jetpack Nailgunner Police Skibidi Toilet from the Skibidi series.
*Despite having nailguns in the original series, it shoots rockets in the game.
